customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Use.tooltip =  The F-key block interaction (opens doors, chests, benches). Not right-click.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Secondary.tooltip =  The right-click action channel (often placing a block or an item's secondary use).
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Primary.tooltip =  The left-click action channel.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Held.tooltip =  The passive active-hotbar channel, not a click. Does not mean "is holding".
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Wielding.tooltip =  The guard/block channel, not "item in hand".
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.Equipped.tooltip =  The armor channel. Targets the armor slot set by Equip Slot.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.InteractionType.option.HeldOffhand.tooltip =  The passive offhand/utility channel.
